  "body": "## Summary\n- Sync Sepo-managed infrastructure from `self-evolving/repo@v0.1.0` (`2e52123`).\n- Update `.agent/`, `.github/actions/`, `.github/prompts/`, agent workflows, and `test-scripts.yml` while preserving site-specific files such as `deploy.yml` and issue/dependabot templates.\n- Include the v0.1.0 `acpx` dependency bump to `^0.6.1` and all new update/onboarding/project-manager/release workflows.\n\n## Verification\n- Confirmed all 249 managed files match `self-evolving/repo@v0.1.0` exactly.\n- `cd .agent && npm ci && npm test` — 515 tests passing.\n- Parsed workflow/action YAML with Ruby.\n- Validated gh-authenticated workflow steps have `GH_TOKEN`.\n- `bash -n` on agent shell scripts and action shell script.\n- `git diff --check`.\n\nCloses #36.\n",
